<?xml version="1.0"?>
<ScenContainer xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xmlns:xsd="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema">
  <ScenTitle>Better Bullets -AMRAAM-, 1987</ScenTitle>
  <ScenDescription>&lt;BODY scroll=auto&gt;&lt;P&gt;With development of the AMRAAM undergoing the all-too-common difficulties, an exercise is being held to justify its importance. This scenario set is an exercise considering the possibility of a hostile air power using a similar missile against the USAF. &lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;-In this scenario, the opponent is armed with advanced AMRAAMs.&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;-As the opposing planes are crewed by the best Agressor pilots to back up their missiles, expect a brutally difficult fight.&lt;/P&gt;&lt;/BODY&gt;</ScenDescription>
